QuestGuidance.Register("en",379,{
[12097]="7001A4AF\n1\tTalk to Mothelen at Echad Mothelen\tMothelen is at Echad Mothelen, far to the north-east from Amon Angened. Dannaswen has suggested you speak with Mothelen regarding the recently discovered enemy encampment in the western Dourstocks.\n",
[12098]="7001CC68\n1\tTalk to Dannaswen atop Amon Angened\tDannaswen is at Amon Angened, atop Amon Angened to the north, above Echad Mothelen. Glamodúd has asked you to speak with Dannaswen regarding the Orc-camp near the Gostannon in the north.\n",
[12099]="70054679\n1\tDefeat Orc sentries in Zhar Skator (total: 12)\tOrc sentries in Zhar Skator, west of Barad Angarth, hinder the plans of the Rangers and must be defeated.\n2\tLocate Dolenthol in Zhar Skator\tYou defeated Orc sentries in in Zhar Skator. You should seek out Dolenthol in the Orc encampment west of Barad Angarth and inform him of your success.\n",
[12100]="700001B3\n1\tCollect weapons from weapon-crates (total: 10)\tUrugarth is in Carn Dûm to the west of Gath Forthnír. Throst devised a clever plan to steal supplies from the Enemy and use them to equip the resistance at Gath Forthnír.\n2\tBring the weapons to Throst\tThrost is at Gath Forthnír, east of Carn Dûm. You should return to Throst with tidings of your victory.\n",
[12101]="70062E7C\n1\tLook in the direction of Sírlond from the tower above the bridge of Caranost\030Find the tower overlooking the bridge with a good view of Sírlond\tThe tower about which Maedhril is concerned is to the west across the bridge from Sírlond.\n2\tTalk to Maedhril at Sírlond\tMaedhril is at Sírlond, east of Caranost proper.\n",
[12102]="7004A8F2\n1\tDefeat spiders of Shelob's brood in Cirith Ungol (total: 18)\tSpiders of Shelob's brood can be found throughout Cirith Ungol. You have encountered many spiders in Cirith Ungol. You should defeat them and allow the Orcs to regain control of Cirith Ungol.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many spiders of Shelob's brood in Cirith Ungol.\n",
[12103]="70030A2E\n1\tFree critters from traps in the Entwalk (total: 5)\tTraps can be found within the Entwalk. The Orcs have laid traps throughout the forest to catch small squirrels and foxes.\n2\tTalk to Dernstan\tDernstan is at Eaworth. Dernstan will be pleased to hear that many of the Orc-traps have been destroyed and several squirrels and foxes rescued.\n",
[12104]="7002F30A\n1\tDefeat Orcs in the Entwalk (total: 10)\tOrcs can be found in the Entwalk. Dernstan has asked you to venture within the Entwalk and defeat the Orcs pillaging the forest.\n2\tTalk to Dernstan at Eaworth\tDernstan is at Eaworth. Dernstan will be pleased to hear that the Orcs within the Entwalk have been thinned.\n",
[12105]="70000633\n1\tDeliver the mushrooms to Trumric Ragwort in Buckland\030Collect wild mushrooms (total: 20)\tWild mushrooms can be found along the eastern banks of the Brandywine River, north of Bucklebury. Trumric Ragwort has asked you to gather wild mushrooms from the banks of the Brandywine River. He informed you that the mushrooms are to be used to help build a menu worthy of the Shire at Adso Haybank's inn.\n",
[12106]="7004E456\n1\tCards hang from the Party Tree. Each card contains a scavenger hunt to complete at your own pace. When you complete a scavenger hunt, bring the completed card to Odilia Rumble for a reward!\t\n2\tTalk to Odilia Rumble\tOdilia Rumble can be found next to the Party Tree in the Shire. You should speak to Odilia Rumble to receive your reward for completing a scavenger hunt card!\n",
